<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco BHIF cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco BHIF cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analysts Petru Vaduva and Nuno Fernandes have reduced their rating for Chile's Banco BHIF to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- They said in an April 8 report the cut came because of the stock's strong performance. It has risen 26 percent in the past three months.</p>
<p>-- The price target remained at $23.80 an American Depositary Receipt (ADR).</p>
<p>-- The company's ADR closed Tuesday at 21-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
